<title>USA: Officemax, Jusco in joint venture.</title>
<headline>Officemax, Jusco in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>OfficeMax Inc and Tokyo-based retail chain Jusco Co Ltd said Wednesday they had formed a joint venture to operate OfficeMax superstores in Japan.</p>
<p>Initially, OfficeMax will own a 19 percent interest in the venture. Under the venture agreement, OfficeMax can raise its stake in the future to as much as 50 percent.</p>
<p>The companies said they had also agreed to explore additional Asian joint venture possibilities outside Japan where Jusco already has a presence.</p>
</text>
